# Local build log

`docs/guia-studio-capacity.md` is a local Notion guide. It is gitignored and must not be committed.

After finishing a phase, feature, or meaningful set of files:

1. Append a new `Phase N` section (do not rewrite earlier phases unless a fact was wrong)
2. Include: what we implemented, files added/changed and why, decisions actually made
3. Write in English
4. Document only work that landed — not what the app still lacks

When the user asks to copy it to Notion, point them at that file.
